enough to heal the MP yourself. Praying is also used for lighting candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.poster.avif?t=1754414826\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.webm?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/53eb561d6f99b7ec40771ab649afcd25.mp4?t=1754414826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden events could randomly happen while exploring the dungeon. It's up to you to check it out.</p>",
